:: Garden South Street
<<initPlayState>>\
<<pronouns "xavier">>\
<<if !Flags.get("xavierFirstWorkWalk") && World.isWeekday() && World.isBefore(8, 30)>>\
<<goto "Xavier First Morning Walk">>\
<</if>>\
<<run World.setLocation("garden-south-street", "Garden South Street")>>\
You are on Garden South Street. You live in an apartment complex here, and it is close to Azure Square. There's a pet store and care center, as well as a café on this street, however, <<Xavier>> considers the café to be more of a "breakfast restaurant".

Places of Interest
<<icon "apartment">><<link "Enter the apartment complex <span class='action-time'>(0:00)</span>">><<goto "Apartment Hallway Lower">><</link>>
<<foodIcon "breakfast-restaurant" "omelette-dish">><<link "Enter the breakfast restaurant <span class='action-time'>(0:01)</span>">><<run World.advance(1)>><<goto "Breakfast Restaurant">><</link>>
<<icon "pet-store">><<link "Visit the pet store <span class='action-time'>(0:02)</span>">><<run World.advance(2)>><<goto "Pet Store">><</link>>
<<icon "pet-care-center">><<link "Visit the pet care center <span class='action-time'>(0:03)</span>">><<run World.advance(3)>><<goto "Pet Care Center">><</link>>

Travel
<<link "Azure Square <span class='action-time'>(0:05)</span>">><<run World.advance(5)>><<goto "Azure Square">><</link>>

